 never be reconstructed into ``EXITED``.","enum":["SUCCESS","VALIDATION_FAILURE","NOT_APPLICABLE","UNAVAILABLE","RUNTIME_FAILURE","CANCELLED","TIMED_OUT","PROTOCOL_VIOLATION"],"title":"ProcessExitCategory","type":"string"},"ProcessIdentity":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Restart-portable identity of one supervised process (plan 3.7, spec 15.1).\n\nPID alone is insufficient because Windows may reuse it; ownership requires\nthe durable creation identity, the executable path and hash from the\nexplicit catalog, and the supervisor instance. A nested value object, so it\ncarries no envelope ``schema_version`` (plan section 3.1). The path is stored\nas observed text and is never resolved or opened here.","properties":{"creation_identity":{"maxLength":1024,"minLength":1,"title":"Creation Identity","type":"string"},"executable_hash":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Sha256"},"executable_path":{"maxLength":1024,"minLength":1,"pattern":"^[^\\u0000-\\u0020\\u007f\\u0085\\u00a0\\u1680\\u2000-\\u200a\\u2028-\\u2029\\u202f\\u205f\\u3000](?:[^\\u0000-\\u001f\\u007f]*[^\\u0000-\\u0020\\u007f\\u0085\\u00a0\\u1680\\u2000-\\u200a\\u2028-\\u2029\\u202f\\u205f\\u3000])?(?![\\s\\S])","title":"Executable Path","type":"string"},"pid":{"maximum":4294967295,"minimum":1,"title":"Pid","type":"integer"},"supervisor_instance_id":{"maxLength":1024,"minLength":1,"title":"Supervisor Instance Id","type":"string"}},"required":["pid","creation_identity","executable_path","executable_hash","supervisor_instance_id"],"title":"ProcessIdentity","type":"object"},"RunId":{"pattern":"^run_[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-4[0-9a-f]{3}-[89ab][0-9a-f]{3}-[0-9a-f]{12}(?![\\s\\S])","type":"string"},"SemanticVersion":{"maxLength":64,"minLength":5,"pattern":"^(0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?![\\s\\S])","type":"string"},"Sha256":{"pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{64}(?![\\s\\S])","type":"string"}},"$id":"urn:crypto-lab:schema:experiments:command-invocation-record:1.0.0","$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"description":"Specification section 11.3: core-owned process facts for one command.\n\nThe twenty-five fields of plan section 3.7 in order. State-governed fields\nare ``MISSING`` when absent, and the validator below is the section 6 shape\ntable; see the module docstring for the rules and the declared task-local\nreadings.","properties":{"adapter_name":{"$ref":"#/$defs/NormalizedIdentifier"},"adapter_version":{"$ref":"#/$defs/SemanticVersion"},"cleanup_complete":{"title":"Cleanup Complete","type":"boolean"},"cleanup_completed_at_utc":{"$ref":"#/$defs/CalendarValidUtcDateTime","title":"Cleanup Completed At Utc"},"command_kind":{"$ref":"#/$defs/CommandKind"},"completed_at_utc":{"$ref":"#/$defs/CalendarValidUtcDateTime","title":"Completed At Utc"},"created_at_utc":{"$ref":"#/$defs/CalendarValidUtcDateTime"},"deadline_utc":{"$ref":"#/$defs/CalendarValidUtcDateTime","title":"Deadline Utc"},"diagnostic_ids":{"items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/DiagnosticId"},"maxItems":64,"title":"Diagnostic Ids","type":"array","uniqueItems":true},"invocation_id":{"$ref":"#/$defs/InvocationId"},"launch_attempted_at_utc":{"$ref":"#/$defs/CalendarValidUtcDateTime","title":"Launch Attempted At Utc"},"native_exit_value":{"$ref":"#/$defs/NativeExitValue","title":"Native Exit Value"},"pid_identity":{"$ref":"#/$defs/ProcessIdentity","title":"Pid Identity"},"primary_diagnostic_id":{"$ref":"#/$defs/DiagnosticId","title":"Primary Diagnostic Id"},"process_created":{"title":"Process Created","type":"boolean"},"process_exit_category":{"$ref":"#/$defs/ProcessExitCategory","title":"Process Exit Category"},"process_started_at_utc":{"$ref":"#/$defs/CalendarValidUtcDateTime","title":"Process Started At Utc"},"request_hash":{"$ref":"#/$defs/Sha256"},"revision":{"minimum":0,"title":"Revision","type":"integer"},"run_id":{"$ref":"#/$defs/RunId","title":"Run Id"},"schema_version":{"const":"1.0.0","title":"Schema Version","type":"string"},"state":{"$ref":"#/$defs/CommandInvocationState"}